{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-220058","model_call":40,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ prematurity premature preterm \"low birth weight\") (+ \"child abuse\" \"child maltreatment\" neglect) (+ \"difficult temperament\" \"separation from mother\" \"poor attachment\" \"special needs\"))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ prematurity premature preterm \"low birth weight\") (+ \"child abuse\" \"child maltreatment\" neglect) (+ \"difficult temperament\" \"separation from mother\" \"poor attachment\" \"special needs\"))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_42_475361992#7_921660068","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q771","rank":1,"snippet":"or inherited dispositions and a triggering event. Triggering events may include environmental factors, stresses of various kinds, and even physical health problems. The line between physical health and mental health is becoming more blurred as research continues in the area of finding causes for psychiatric disorders. What are the risk factors for psychiatric disorders? A number of factors are thought to increase your chances of developing a psychiatric disorder. However, not everyone with risk factors will develop a psychiatric disorder. Common risk factors are: <cover>Difficult temperament External or environmental factors, such as poverty, poor nutrition, overcrowding, abuse, or neglect Genetic or inherited predisposition such as having a parent with a psychiatric disorder Low birth weight</cover>Lower socioeconomic status Prenatal exposure to alcohol, illegal drugs, tobacco, and certain viruses and toxins Severe parental discord Substance abuse Trauma, either physical or mental Unsatisfactory relationships, especially within the family Reducing your risk of psychiatric disorders If you have or are at risk of developing a psychiatric disorder, leading a healthy lifestyle is important.\" , \"start_char\": 5708.000000 , \"title\": \"Psychiatric Disorders\" , \"url\": \"https://www.healthgrades.com/","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_42_475361992#7_921660068","rank":1,"relevance":0}]},"time":13101},"model_calls":40,"document_judgments":33,"relevance_3":4,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
