{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-220058","model_call":55,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"shaken baby syndrome\" (+ premature prematurity \"low birth weight\") (+ \"risk factors\" \"risk factor\") (+ crying frustration caregiver))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"shaken baby syndrome\" (+ premature prematurity \"low birth weight\") (+ \"risk factors\" \"risk factor\") (+ crying frustration caregiver))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_930063563#12_2018964925","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q784","rank":1,"snippet":"physical punishment represents the only way to free themselves of their frustrations. What are the risk factors for shaken baby syndrome? Risk factors for shaken baby syndrome (as well as other types of inflicted trauma on children) may be conceptualized into two broad categories: Family risk factors Young and/or single parents Lower educational background Unstable family dynamics Financial/food/housing concerns and stresses Domestic violence Drug/ alcohol abuse Parental mental illness, especially postpartum depression Limited or no immediate support system (for example, relatives, church groups, etc.) Unrelated adults staying in the home Infant risk factors Perinatal <cover>risk factors (for example, threatened miscarriage, prematurity, infant malformations, multiple births (twins, triplets, etc.) Colicky infants -- often aggravated by the natural history of increase in infant crying during the first two months of life (see above) Male gender Unwanted pregnancy SLIDESHOW Concussions & Brain Injuries: Symptoms, Tests, Treatment See Slideshow What are shaken baby syndrome </cover>symptoms and signs?\" , \"start_char\": 5780.000000 , \"title\": \"What Is Shaken Baby Syndrome? Symptoms, Signs, Facts\" , \"url\": \"https://www.medicinenet.com/shaken_baby_syndrome_abusive_head_trauma/article.htm\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_930063563#12_2018964925","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":61},"model_calls":55,"document_judgments":45,"relevance_3":6,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
